{"caveats":[],"characterization":[],"evidence":[{"char_end":990,"char_start":896,"chunk_id":"mdchk_b90ef0af6adf686c","document_char_end":66994,"document_char_start":66900,"evidence_id":"ev_df7b10f34772f1ea","paper_id":"DOI:10.1038_s41467-024-50605-5","quote":"The stability test was conducted in 1 M KOH solution within a sealed 200 mL electrolytic cell.","source_sha256":"737246abfae47db049b2df1fb89d8f7f5a03b160d6c2f1fe70ed41145d8b7d18"},{"char_end":1137,"char_start":991,"chunk_id":"mdchk_b90ef0af6adf686c","document_char_end":67141,"document_char_start":66995,"evidence_id":"ev_d448c77edcd936fd","paper_id":"DOI:10.1038_s41467-024-50605-5","quote":"A zero-gap alkaline water electrolyzer was assembled using PSCFM/NF and Pt/C/NF as the anode and cathode, respectively (NF refers to nickel foam).","source_sha256":"737246abfae47db049b2df1fb89d8f7f5a03b160d6c2f1fe70ed41145d8b7d18"},{"char_end":1267,"char_start":1138,"chunk_id":"mdchk_b90ef0af6adf686c","document_char_end":67271,"document_char_start":67142,"evidence_id":"ev_3ac95a02dc13627c","paper_id":"DOI:10.1038_s41467-024-50605-5","quote":"Electrochemical measurements were performed at room temperature using a CHI 760E electrochemical workstation (Chenhua, Shanghai).","source_sha256":"737246abfae47db049b2df1fb89d8f7f5a03b160d6c2f1fe70ed41145d8b7d18"},{"char_end":1788,"char_start":1591,"chunk_id":"mdchk_b90ef0af6adf686c","document_char_end":67792,"document_char_start":67595,"evidence_id":"ev_53a7e534067df771","paper_id":"DOI:10.1038_s41467-024-50605-5","quote":"The two electrodes were separated by a pre-treated alkaline exchange membrane (Fumasep FAA-3-30, thickness ∼30 μm, FuMA- Tech), Prior to use, the membrane was immersed in 6 M KOH solution for 12 h.","source_sha256":"737246abfae47db049b2df1fb89d8f7f5a03b160d6c2f1fe70ed41145d8b7d18"},{"char_end":1893,"char_start":1789,"chunk_id":"mdchk_b90ef0af6adf686c","document_char_end":67897,"document_char_start":67793,"evidence_id":"ev_f3296e6224829562","paper_id":"DOI:10.1038_s414